  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></h1>\n<h1>自動伐木器</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p>這是一個 Minecraft 數據包，當您<strong>蹲下時用斧頭破壞原木</strong>，它會自動砍倒整棵樹。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356258/description_fee850f2-e7d4-4760-81b3-acfbe5a851d3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<h2>注意事項</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此功能僅在您蹲下（潛行）時才會觸發</li>\n<li>若您只想破壞單一方塊，請在不蹲下的情況下正常破壞原木</li>\n<li>樹葉掉落物與手動破壞時相同（包含樹苗和木棍）</li>\n<li>連續使用之間設有短暫冷卻時間，以避免影響遊戲效能</li>\n</ul>",
